# Local instance: instance defined in an inner dict, method dispatched from same scope.
# The local Addable instance for MyT must be found in frame.group before
# the effect chain is traversed.
# Two-dict pattern: first dict is private (type + instance), second is output.
[
  MyT: [type MyT]
  [instance Addable [let a@MyT b@MyT c]: [+: [fn [let x y] [merge [l: x] [r: y]]]]]
]
[result: [+ MyT.MyT MyT.MyT]]
=== out
["result": ["l": MyT.MyT  "r": MyT.MyT]]
